WEBVTT

00:07:29.639 --> 00:07:33.924
and I named my daughter after her.

00:07:33.924 --> 00:07:36.916
A few days after Malala was born,

00:07:36.916 --> 00:07:38.655
my daughter was born,

00:07:38.655 --> 00:07:40.313
my cousin came --

00:07:40.313 --> 00:07:42.281
and it was a coincidence --

00:07:42.281 --> 00:07:44.996
he came to my home

00:07:44.996 --> 00:07:47.701
and he brought a family tree,

00:07:47.701 --> 00:07:51.369
a family tree of the Yousafzai family,

00:07:51.369 --> 00:07:53.925
and when I looked at the family tree,

00:07:53.925 --> 00:07:59.978
it traced back to 300 years of our ancestors.

00:07:59.978 --> 00:08:04.375
But when I looked, all were men,